    240→#### .pause()
    242→Put queue execution on hold.
    355→#### .size
    357→Size of the queue, the number of queued items waiting to run.
    419→#### .pending
    421→Number of running items (no longer in the queue).
    440→#### [.concurrency](#concurrency)
    442→#### .isPaused
    444→Whether the queue is currently paused.
